    {
      "id": "e59a7705",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 算术运算符\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "944601c0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "* `+x`是一元加运算（恒等运算）；\n* `-x`是一元减法（符号改变为相反符号）；\n* `x + y`是加法；\n* `x - y`是减法；\n* `x * y`是乘法；\n* `x / y`是除法；\n* `x ÷ y`是整数除法（四舍五入到最接近的整数）；\n* `x \\ y`是带反转的除法（等同于`y / x`）；\n* `x ^ y`是幂运算（`x`乘以`y`次幂）；\n* `x % y`是`x`除以`y`的余数；\n* `Sqrt(x)`是`x`的平方根。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f334f70c",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "运算顺序遵循标准规则：首先求一元运算，接着是幂运算，然后是`* `、`/`、`÷`、`\\`、`%`，最后是加法和减法。\n\n如果将数值因子紧贴在变量或括号之前，例如`2x`或`2(x+y)`，则被视为乘法，其优先级高于其他二进制运算。\n\n以下是几个使用算术运算符的简单示例：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
