    },
    {
      "id": "15060ab3",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 逻辑运算符\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e6a17e9c",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "逻辑类型（`Bool`）支持以下逻辑运算符：\n* `!x`表示否定（NOT）。将`true`转换为`false`，反之亦然；\n* `x && y`表示逻辑乘法（合取，AND）；\n* `x || y`是逻辑加法（析取，OR）。\n\n`Bool`是一个整数类型，所有算术和比较运算符也已为此类型定义。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "58654cd8",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务3\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
