    {
      "id": "3f49f0ec",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 带赋值的运算符\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2ba81dcc",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "所有二进制算术运算符均有一个带赋值的**版本**，该版本将结果赋值给左侧的被操作数。要使用二进制运算符的赋值版本，必须在运算符后紧跟`=`符号。赋值运算符会重新定义左侧变量的值。例如，表达式`x += 3`等同于`x = x + 3`。\n\n示例。首先，我们将值`1`赋给变量`x`，然后添加`3`，并将结果存储在同一变量`x`中。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "88c4169d",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "x = 1\r\nx += 3"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c7703595",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "二进制算术和位运算赋值运算符的所有形式：\n```\r\n+=  -=  *=  /=  \\=  ÷=  %=  ^=  &=  |=  ⊻=  >>>=  >>=  <<=\r\n```\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "506fed5a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##  带点号的向量运算符\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "91ed218d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "对于每种二进制运算（`+`、`-`、`* `、`/`、`^`等），都存在相应的点运算，即`.+`、`.-`、`.* `、`./`、`.^`等。在此情况下，运算针对数组中的每个值逐元素进行。例如，运算`[1, 2, 3] ^ 3`是未定义的，因为对非方阵求立方在标准数学中没有相应的运算。然而，以下运算是有定义的\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0f8393a2",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "[1, 2, 3] .^ 3"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1f3079cf",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "该运算会逐元素计算出向量结果`[1^3, 2^3, 3^3]`。\n\n点运算允许您将数组与标量值组合、将相同大小的数组相互组合，甚至组合不同大小的数组（例如，将水平向量和垂直向量组合以创建矩阵）。\n\n{% note info \"注意\" %}\n\n在将点运算符与数值表达式结合使用时，可能会产生歧义。例如，`1.+x`表示什么？它可能是`1. + x`，也可能是`1 .+ x`。因此，这种语法是不被允许的；在这种情况下，必须在运算符两侧添加空格。\n\n{% endnote %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ad6b497e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###  ✏️任务5\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ee5733b2",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "定义数组`x = [5 3 8 7 2]`。使用公式$y=(x^2+3x+1)^5$计算数组`y`。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
