    },
    {
      "id": "e46403fa",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "与大多数语言不同，**Julia** 允许使用任意的比较链。\r\n\r\n例如：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
